      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Base (rounds 1 to 4)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 1: Magic ring, 6 dc. (6 dc.) Round 2: 2 dc into every stitch. (12 dc.) Round 3: *1 dc, 2 dc into next*. Repeat. (18 dc.) Round 4: *1 dc x 2, 2 dc into next*. Repeat. (24 dc.) Check: base should measure about 10 cm across."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Sides (rounds 5 to 14)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 5: Work 1 dc into the back loop only around (fold line). Rounds 6 to 14: 1 dc into every stitch in spiral (approximately 7 cm). Sl st to close. Fasten off."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Finishing"
          }
        ]
      },
